<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Templeton raises Pioneer stake.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Templeton raises Pioneer stake.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. fund manager Templeton Worldwide Inc has raised its stake in Australian building materials group Pioneer International Ltd to 9.22 percent from 8.21 percent.</p>
<p>Templeton said in a substantial shareholder notice to the Australian Stock Exchange that it now held 81.73 million Pioneer shares.</p>
<p>The stake is worth about A$282.8 million, based on the latest share price of A$3.46.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
